* Demonstration 6: echo the console.  CTRL-C goes back to the monitor.
ECHO     SAY     MEC1
         R       CRLF
EC1      S0      CSTA,0
         S0      S0<D'63
         JSP     EC1
         S1      CDAT,0
         OUTCH
         S2      15
         S0      S1\S2
         JSN     EC1
         S1      12                      ; a line feed after a return
         OUTCH
         J       EC1
MEC1     DATA    'TYPE.  CTRL-C GOES BACK TO THE MONITOR.',0
